OL,3,AKey convicted Palestine Action member
OL,4,Aon the run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA key member of Palestine Action, who
OL,7,Fis currently on the run, has been
OL,8,Fconvicted in his absence over a
OL,9,Fbreak-in that caused damage put at
OL,10,F#1.2m to an arms firm.
OL,12,FSean Middlebrough, 33, originally from
OL,13,FLiverpool, absconded in October last
OL,14,Fyear after being granted bail for his
OL,15,Fbrother's wedding. The self-proclaimed
OL,16,Frevolutionary communist has since sent
OL,17,Fmessages to supporters describing
OL,18,Fhimself as a "prisoner of war".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
